# Route: guide 28 of 53 of the simulator's completionist route for NightElf
# (1445 of 1459 eligible quests, 164.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 48 to
# 49, 30 quests, 3.0 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (The Barrens): Bael Modan -> Ratchet -> The Merchant Coast -> Ratchet
# -> The Merchant Coast -> Ratchet -> The Sludge Fen -> Ratchet -> The
# Merchant Coast -> Ratchet -> The Sludge Fen -> Boulder Lode Mine -> Ratchet
# -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Trouble at the Docks (959; Mad
# Magglish 18); Chol'aruk the Ravener (97005; Chol'aruk 20).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Mortality Wanes (1142), Willix the Importer (1144),
# Blueleaf Tubers (1221), Blueleaf Tubers (1221), Deviate Eradication (1487),
# Deviate Eradication (1487), The Glowing Shard (6981).

